      "en": "The angel whom I saw standing on the sea and on the land lifted up his right hand to the sky",
      "ko": "내가 본바 바다와 땅을 밟고 섰는 천사가 하늘을 향하여 오른손을 들고",
      "source_text_hash": "db174e45e94b6eccdb25c3d631b78c39f07bdbd035c2f61e66344559cd2178c4",
      "translation_text_hash": "dc7708e1d5db17d7ee0d25bc2bb4541cf34216d56fcc2bd702b61ce58af4df05",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
